    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57135" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κήξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κηκός, ἡ</span>, a sea-bird, perh. the <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tern</i> or <i>sea-swallow</i>, 
